    {
        "text": "3:22 P.M. \\ Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Underground structure, Sudean Borough, Londinium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think this is a very smart decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rockrock, we don't have enough hands. There are many places above us where people can hide, and we still haven't checked at least a third of Sudean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know Harmo and the gang are getting ready for the move already. In a couple days, they will be leaving this place, and so will the commander.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "When that happens, even if our team stays, our chances of rescuing anyone will be slim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's no reason for them to join us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They aren't joining us... They're cooperating with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you hear the commander? They're friends of a friend. We accepted our friend's request and helped them enter Londinium, and they're here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if they can help us look for people...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They can rest up in our hideout. That's the commander's order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "And once they're done resting up, they'll leave this place. I'll escort them to somewhere safe aboveground, and that'll be the end of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why can't we ask them if they're willing to stay for a short while? It'll just be a small favor. They might not turn us down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know why. I told you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The commander thinks they can be trusted. There has to be a reason for that, so I'll stop questioning their motives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I also don't want our men dragged into needless danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you think what they're doing is dangerous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think they're doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "They sneaked into Londinium with a bunch of highly skilled Sarkaz, and they're making an enemy of those other Sarkaz... Feist, we're Victorians. We're used to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking about the lords fighting day in and day out outside Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since we were born, they've been fighting amongst themselves to no end. If it wasn't because of all their infighting, our homes wouldn't have become a Sarkaz backyard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's tiring enough trying to take back our homes... The Sarkaz want to fight on our lands, and not only is there nothing we can do about it, it has nothing to do with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But what if they can really stop the Sarkaz occupying the city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you think they're here to snatch the crown, but the way I see it, we have a common enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not so confident to think that we can take control of the situation. Not like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz... they're nothing like you think. They're that good at pretending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "The day my dad was executed, I spotted a girl in the distance... The executioner called her 'Your Majesty.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was when I found out what the king of the devils actually looked like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You never told me that before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I never saw the need to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm telling you this now because... I want you to know we can't let ourselves be deceived by looks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though the Sarkaz woman had a flawless, unblemished appearance, even if she put up a look of pity for an old Londinier worker, totally unknown to her, I will never forget...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She is the one who led the Sarkaz and killed my father... and countless more Victorians...! She's the Lord of Fiends!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh... Miss Amiya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Feist, Miss Rockrock...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all I have to say, Captain. I will head aboveground and continue our search mission. You... You should really give what I said some thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Miss Amiya, Doctor... Um, I need to help Harmo tune his equipment... so please excuse me too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, the Sarkaz that Miss Rockrock mentioned...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "We don't have enough information yet.;......;Doesn't sound like Theresis to me.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a white-haired woman with a compassionate look... and the Sarkaz called her 'Your Majesty.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, you might have forgotten, but I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will never forget even the tiniest detail about her expression or anything she said to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You mean...;......;No way!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know it's impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_bridge",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr.{@nickname}, from today onwards, you have the permission to access the following files.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some of the information in these files will be of interest to you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether it's information about her, or information on the powers that Amiya has inherited.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You talked about this, and you didn't believe me.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this point in time, trust is meaningless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't deny the importance you hold to Amiya, and the thing she needs most in this Londinium operation is your assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what you two find in Londinium, you have to face it with her, together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you can do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
