    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn, the Dublinn forces are acting really strange!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're going... that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought Sarkaz troops were guarding that area, though? Dublinn would never have dared to go anywhere close with them around!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They must have their reasons. I'll tail them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that a tad risky...? They have ten times our manpower.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why I'm going alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rest of you will continue as planned. Look for resources at their stronghold. They've just started relocating. Most likely, they haven't had the time to haul their supplies away too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, get a move on. The commander doesn't want us to waste another second!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you don't want to be doing this. Who does? Those stinking devils, treating us like a bunch of mercenaries!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't let me see you slacking off. You better not embarrass the commander in front of the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why aren't you keeping up? M-611, respond!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
