    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, now you can speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough*, *cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, what are you helping the Sarkaz with?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "L-Like I'd tell you, you wicked Victorian wolf...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me think... How did Dublinn treat the Victorians who weren't willing to talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were hanged on a pulley a dozen meters off the ground, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad, I don't know how to make stone columns with Arts. I don't have an easy way to send someone so high up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You wouldn't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "True, if I were as shameless as your commander, watching my people sacrifice themselves in County Hillock one by one wouldn't have bothered me one bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about this, then? I'll tie you up, and then dump you in some abandoned factory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are lots of factories like that around here. It wouldn't take that long to look through each of them one by one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that's how I do things, right? It's thanks to my patience that I could rescue some of those poor soldiers from you people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only hope that your commanding officer will find you too before you die alone, despairing in the darkness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... No! My commander wouldn't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, spare me. What do you want to know? I just follow orders. I don't understand the complicated stuff!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm quite sure of that. That Sarkaz commander is much smarter than your commanding officer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever he is scheming, Mandragora will never figure it out, and you lads will have to keep letting the Sarkaz toy with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, you just need to tell me where you are headed, then. I'll figure out the rest myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
