    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're back, why didn't you pay me a visit sooner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have too many guests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I forgot. You didn't want to see the Confessarius Messenger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If he found out that I came back to Londinium, wouldn't that spell the end of my leisurely days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even then, you didn't have to wait for Hoederer to leave before you show yourself. He's my man. He won't ever report your presence to the court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, he's your man? Don't fool yourself; you don't trust anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really trusted him, you could've just hollered my name. You're the one who decided to wait till the Dublinn Feline and your mercenary friends were gone before saying hello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's set this topic aside. You helped me lure the Dublinn forces into position this morning. I owe you this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... It's no big deal. Besides, I got a little surprise out of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A surprise...? For you, of all people, to use that word, I'm guessing you found more than a few rebels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... Did you meet the Rhodes Islanders down there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's more. Not only did I run into them, they were the ones who 'rescued' me from Dublinn and escorted me to the city walls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it wasn't for how antsy you were to test your prized new toy, such that I had to be 'blown up' in front of them, perhaps I could've followed them a little longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I actually wanted to have a good chat with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if I tell you there's still a chance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Another job for me? Didn't you send the Dublinns and the mercenaries to guard the temporary brig? I thought you had everything in place already, and you just had to extend an invitation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I prefer writing myself a few insurance policies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright. You owe us one, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... Did I just say 'us?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter. There's no one else here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Truth be told, we don't really want to stay here for much longer... That narcissistic old man with the chalice is almost here, isn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell him about us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course... I have yet to repay your kindness, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another note... You should stop masquerading as a dead man. Not only might you find your cover blown, it also... makes me feel uneasy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah, we almost forgot. What an upstanding Sarkaz you are, right, pupil of Theresis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. The next time we meet, I won't be 'Mr. Thomas' anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen?"
    },
